{"Categories":[8],"HiddenTopics":[24],"Topics":[13],"Id":55,"TextResource":{"Name":"gatsby-cafeteria","Translations":[{"Text":"Gatsby Cafeteria","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"Gatsby Cafeteria","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[{"FloorId":"3","Id":87},{"FloorId":"3","Id":137}]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>Con presencia en todos los rincones del aeropuerto, Gatsby ofrece gran variedad de sándwiches y ensaladas, coronado con un excelente buffet que complace los gustos de toda la familia. Además, su cafetería de nivel te brinda un espacio de calma en cada visita.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>With a presence in every corner of the airport, Gatsby offers a variety of sandwiches and salads, crowned by an excellent buffet that pleases all tastes in the family. Its high-level coffee shop also offers you a peaceful atmosphere every time you visit.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1488916780","Updated":"1489712604","Picture":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/055_gatsby-cafeteria.png"},"Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":{"1":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/en\/viadirect\/371\/node\/326","Abbreviation":""},"0":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/es\/viadirect\/371\/node\/326","Abbreviation":""}}},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/055_gatsby-cafeteria.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/55\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/055_gatsby-cafeteria.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/55\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[{"key":"field_opening_hours","label":"Opening hours","field_name":"field_restaurant_opening_hours"},{"key":"field_phone","label":"Phone","field_name":"field_restaurant_phone"},{"key":"field_website","label":"Website","fiel